WEBVTT

01:30.850 --> 01:34.970
[Legend of the Magnate]

01:35.030 --> 01:37.950
[Episode 5]

02:01.840 --> 02:02.400
Gu.

02:06.610 --> 02:08.030
I've been watching you for a while

02:08.030 --> 02:09.630
but didn't dare to say hello.

02:10.280 --> 02:10.800
Why?

02:11.170 --> 02:12.100
Afraid I'd jump?

02:12.550 --> 02:14.800
If you wanted to jump,
you would've done it back in Ningguta.

02:14.800 --> 02:16.860
You wouldn't have waited till today.

02:17.470 --> 02:18.280
I couldn't sleep,

02:18.280 --> 02:20.430
so I came out to think about
something on my mind—

02:20.430 --> 02:21.890
to think about the future.

02:24.600 --> 02:25.310
I know.

02:25.840 --> 02:27.590
You must be thinking about your mother

02:27.590 --> 02:29.790
and feeling sad on your own, aren't you?

02:32.470 --> 02:35.400
Sometimes, when the road
is blocked by snow and wind,

02:35.470 --> 02:36.870
I'd sit alone outside,

02:37.240 --> 02:39.040
and I'd often think of my mother.

02:40.120 --> 02:41.150
My memories of her

02:41.470 --> 02:42.430
are very vague.

02:42.750 --> 02:44.470
I only remember that when she was buried,

02:44.470 --> 02:45.870
her hair was still black.

02:46.800 --> 02:47.910
As for what kind of person she was

02:47.910 --> 02:49.430
and what her temperament was like,

02:49.430 --> 02:50.520
I've asked my father,

02:50.520 --> 02:51.850
but he wouldn't tell me.

02:52.800 --> 02:54.660
You're the same as me, aren't you?

02:58.630 --> 02:59.900
You miss your mother.

03:01.280 --> 03:03.180
But as for me, my mother is
still in Huizhou,

03:03.180 --> 03:04.360
yet I can't go back to her

03:04.360 --> 03:05.960
or fulfill my filial duties.

03:06.190 --> 03:08.400
She raised my brother and me
all by herself,

03:08.400 --> 03:10.320
hoping I would succeed
in the imperial examinations.

03:10.320 --> 03:12.720
Who would have thought
I'd end up like this?

03:14.430 --> 03:15.840
In Ningguta, everyone dreams

03:15.840 --> 03:16.870
of escaping.

03:17.590 --> 03:19.720
But once you really escape, then what?

03:20.400 --> 03:21.400
The world is vast,

03:21.710 --> 03:23.300
yet there's nowhere to settle.

03:23.300 --> 03:26.560
Only a home I cannot return to,
and a country I cannot serve.

03:27.240 --> 03:29.300
I remember when I was young
in the private school,

03:29.300 --> 03:30.870
the teacher would start singing opera

03:30.870 --> 03:32.130
whenever he got drunk,

03:32.470 --> 03:35.000
sometimes it was
"Lin Chong's Night Escape."

03:35.280 --> 03:37.079
The lance instructor
of 800,000 imperial guards

03:37.079 --> 03:38.120
fleeing in haste,

03:38.890 --> 03:41.550
forced to abandon
both loyalty and filial duty.

03:42.210 --> 03:43.470
Thinking about it now,

03:43.590 --> 03:46.250
it truly makes me
want to weep together with him.

03:54.750 --> 03:55.910
Is that why

03:56.190 --> 03:57.680
you were so determined to

03:59.150 --> 04:00.010
take this deal?

04:07.560 --> 04:08.360
I'm worried.

04:10.080 --> 04:10.800
About what?

04:16.760 --> 04:18.890
I'm worried that when we get to Horqin,

04:20.300 --> 04:21.360
you'll stay there.

04:23.670 --> 04:25.070
Why would you think that?

04:28.510 --> 04:29.910
You can't hide it from me.

04:33.070 --> 04:34.670
If I stay by Mr. Chang's side,

04:35.530 --> 04:36.270
I would only bring

04:36.270 --> 04:38.000
greater trouble upon you guys.

04:39.110 --> 04:40.710
I can't just think of myself.

04:41.190 --> 04:41.950
If you guys can

04:41.950 --> 04:43.350
return safely this time,

04:43.950 --> 04:44.720
it will be my way

04:44.720 --> 04:46.520
of repaying his great kindness.

04:49.370 --> 04:51.270
Who asked you to repay any kindness?

04:51.270 --> 04:52.730
You're truly ridiculous.

04:55.940 --> 04:57.200
What's wrong with you?

04:59.530 --> 05:00.460
I'm going to bed.

05:00.630 --> 05:01.630
Go ahead and jump!

05:12.360 --> 05:12.960
Father.

05:13.870 --> 05:14.390
This...

05:14.830 --> 05:15.920
Where is this?

05:16.820 --> 05:17.630
How come I never knew

05:17.630 --> 05:19.690
we had such a large space in our house?

05:31.920 --> 05:33.520
These gold and silver ingots

05:33.750 --> 05:35.430
were just taken out

05:35.430 --> 05:36.960
from the official furnace.

05:37.230 --> 05:39.159
Most of the items against this wall

05:39.480 --> 05:41.409
are freshwater pearls from Goryeo

05:42.310 --> 05:43.440
and Hotan fine jade.

05:48.030 --> 05:49.760
These are all medicinal herbs.

05:54.070 --> 05:55.630
And this is the ginseng

05:55.650 --> 05:57.450
you brought back from Ningguta.

05:59.630 --> 06:00.120
Father.

06:00.650 --> 06:01.880
Do you have something

06:01.900 --> 06:02.960
you want to tell me?

06:04.920 --> 06:05.950
The ancients say

06:07.160 --> 06:09.920
it's easier to start a business
than to maintain it.

06:09.920 --> 06:12.240
All these years, I've been telling you

06:12.510 --> 06:14.480
to find a shop

06:15.040 --> 06:16.480
and learn business properly

06:16.480 --> 06:18.880
instead of rushing into starting your own.

06:18.920 --> 06:21.180
As long as you run the business steadily,

06:21.270 --> 06:22.870
preserve our family wealth,

06:23.070 --> 06:24.830
and pass it down to the next generation,

06:24.830 --> 06:26.830
that's already remarkable enough.

06:30.870 --> 06:32.720
Can you not go to Shanxi?

06:32.830 --> 06:33.310
Father.

06:33.680 --> 06:35.000
You've already promised me.

06:35.000 --> 06:36.060
I must go to Shanxi.

06:36.360 --> 06:38.090
I'm taking back my promise now.

06:38.870 --> 06:39.800
I shouldn't have

06:39.830 --> 06:40.950
let you go to Ningguta

06:40.950 --> 06:42.560
to see all that commotion
in the first place.

06:42.560 --> 06:44.270
If anyone found out

06:44.390 --> 06:46.070
you've been associating

06:46.120 --> 06:47.790
with that escaped exile

06:48.270 --> 06:50.470
and reported it to the imperial censor,

06:50.510 --> 06:53.390
it would instantly
bring unimaginable disaster upon us.

06:53.390 --> 06:53.920
Father.

06:54.240 --> 06:55.270
You yourself dare

06:55.270 --> 06:56.270
to defy the imperial court's regulations

06:56.270 --> 06:58.120
by sending ships beyond the pass
for contraband.

06:58.120 --> 06:59.120
Now you blame me

06:59.159 --> 07:00.620
for befriending an exile?

07:01.360 --> 07:03.360
That's why I'm regretting it.

07:04.720 --> 07:07.630
If I hadn't been so greedy back then,

07:08.390 --> 07:10.250
how much better it would've been.

07:12.310 --> 07:12.920
Son.

07:14.510 --> 07:15.970
As long as you listen to me

07:16.000 --> 07:16.800
and stay in the capital,

07:16.800 --> 07:18.680
you can do whatever you want.

07:20.310 --> 07:21.710
I'll go to Shanxi myself.

07:22.920 --> 07:23.510
Father.

07:24.310 --> 07:25.040
If I really wanted

07:25.040 --> 07:26.770
to be like those rich young men,

07:26.800 --> 07:28.630
carrying bird cages around all day,

07:28.630 --> 07:29.480
hanging out in teahouses,

07:29.480 --> 07:30.270
gambling and visiting brothels,

07:30.270 --> 07:31.720
I would have done so long ago.

07:31.720 --> 07:32.630
But all this money

07:32.630 --> 07:33.760
wasn't earned by me.

07:34.240 --> 07:35.310
Keep it for yourself.

07:35.310 --> 07:36.720
I'm definitely going to Shanxi.

07:36.720 --> 07:37.720
Stop right there!

07:40.120 --> 07:42.159
Why can't you just stay home
and enjoy life?

07:42.159 --> 07:43.270
The bigger your business gets,

07:43.270 --> 07:44.870
the more attention you attract.

07:44.870 --> 07:45.920
Once they've fattened you up,

07:45.920 --> 07:47.360
they'll put a knife to your neck,

07:47.360 --> 07:48.390
cut your throat open,

07:48.390 --> 07:49.360
and feast on your flesh and blood!

07:49.360 --> 07:50.270
I'm a person,

07:50.630 --> 07:52.010
not some pet you've raised!

07:52.010 --> 07:53.240
Do you know how those managers

07:53.240 --> 07:54.240
under you see me now?

07:54.240 --> 07:55.360
They think I'm a spoiled heir.

07:55.360 --> 07:56.690
They think I'm useless!

07:57.070 --> 07:58.190
You're Li Baiwan,

07:58.310 --> 08:00.480
the greatest merchant
north of the Yangtze River.

08:00.480 --> 08:01.680
How can you raise

08:01.720 --> 08:02.750
your own child as a good-for-nothing?

08:02.750 --> 08:04.680
Shanxi is not a good place to go.

08:04.720 --> 08:06.500
There's no good place in this world!

08:06.500 --> 08:08.530
You always tell me yourself

08:08.550 --> 08:10.720
that no one will ever give way to anyone.

08:10.720 --> 08:11.360
Did all this money

08:11.360 --> 08:12.040
grow legs

08:12.040 --> 08:13.070
and walk into our house by itself?

08:13.070 --> 08:13.560
Father.

08:14.120 --> 08:16.380
All my life I've wanted to learn from you,

08:16.630 --> 08:17.480
but why do you

08:17.480 --> 08:18.870
keep pushing me away?

08:18.870 --> 08:19.390
Kid.

08:19.390 --> 08:20.870
You're not cut out for business.

08:20.870 --> 08:21.870
You won't make it.

08:28.270 --> 08:30.190
Unless you break my legs,

08:31.160 --> 08:32.080
sew my mouth shut,

08:32.080 --> 08:33.740
and brick me inside that wall.

08:34.320 --> 08:37.780
Otherwise, there's no way you can stop me
from going to Shanxi.

08:52.610 --> 08:56.460
[Black Water Marsh]

09:07.440 --> 09:08.550
Keep up, everyone!

09:09.270 --> 09:11.070
There's a place to rest up ahead.

09:27.600 --> 09:28.440
Patriarch.

09:30.960 --> 09:32.160
Everything's ready.

09:35.960 --> 09:36.720
Guys.

09:37.440 --> 09:39.150
Taking the Black Water Marsh route

09:39.150 --> 09:40.330
is us gambling our lives

09:40.330 --> 09:42.190
with Heaven in exchange for food.

09:44.120 --> 09:44.650
Let's go!

09:47.330 --> 09:48.930
Everyone remember this:

09:49.650 --> 09:51.670
6 people go ahead to scout.

09:52.540 --> 09:54.560
Strike the ground with wooden sticks—

09:54.560 --> 09:55.820
if you can pass, move forward;

09:55.820 --> 09:56.800
if not,

09:57.320 --> 09:58.650
leave markers.

10:00.300 --> 10:01.380
Guys!

10:01.900 --> 10:03.630
Life and death are predestined,

10:03.630 --> 10:05.430
and wealth and honor
are in Heaven's hands!

10:05.430 --> 10:07.570
With auspiciousness, we travel the world.

10:07.570 --> 10:09.790
Wealth keeps us safe!

10:15.930 --> 10:18.180
[Medicine]

10:17.320 --> 10:18.480
It's getting dark!

10:18.660 --> 10:19.950
Everyone stay alert!

10:21.820 --> 10:23.020
Put your back into it!

10:23.230 --> 10:25.490
We'll rest once we get past this stretch.

10:25.740 --> 10:29.130
[Medicine]

10:32.600 --> 10:35.060
Let's take a quick break
behind those trees!

10:36.120 --> 10:38.000
Guys, take a rest!

10:45.390 --> 10:47.020
Mr. Chang! Mr. Chang!

10:47.270 --> 10:49.200
The carriage is stuck in the marsh!

10:53.670 --> 10:54.960
Pull harder! Grab hold of them!

10:54.960 --> 10:56.280
Don't let anyone sink!

11:01.120 --> 11:01.800
Heizi!

11:02.030 --> 11:04.480
Forget the carriage!
Hurry and save our people!

11:04.480 --> 11:05.200
Detach the carriage from the horses

11:05.200 --> 11:06.150
and loosen the reins!

11:06.150 --> 11:07.030
Hurry, save them!

11:07.030 --> 11:08.340
Remove the reins!

11:08.440 --> 11:09.480
Save them!

11:09.510 --> 11:10.750
Save them!

11:17.550 --> 11:18.790
Hurry, save them!

11:22.480 --> 11:23.350
Save them!

11:23.790 --> 11:25.040
Save them!

11:26.610 --> 11:28.250
How did it get stuck?

11:36.000 --> 11:37.860
[Jixiang Caravan]

11:39.800 --> 11:42.190
[Jixiang Caravan]

11:59.240 --> 12:00.910
Miss Chang is in danger!

12:00.930 --> 12:02.670
Miss Chang is in danger!

12:04.080 --> 12:05.000
Father!

12:06.480 --> 12:08.480
Yu'er! Yu'er!

12:09.120 --> 12:09.720
Father!

12:09.720 --> 12:11.380
Yu'er, I'm coming to save you!

12:11.480 --> 12:13.810
-Father!
-How did Miss Chang end up there?

12:14.150 --> 12:15.390
Miss Chang was returning from the toilet

12:15.390 --> 12:16.950
and somehow got lost.

12:17.020 --> 12:18.480
Don't be afraid, Yu'er!

12:18.560 --> 12:20.040
I'm coming to save you!

12:20.390 --> 12:21.080
Mr. Chang!

12:21.550 --> 12:23.480
Mr. Chang, you absolutely cannot!

12:23.600 --> 12:24.320
-Father!
-Come back! Come back!

12:24.320 --> 12:25.450
Yu'er, don't panic!

12:28.890 --> 12:29.690
Mr. Gu!

12:30.390 --> 12:31.750
-Mr. Gu!
-Mr. Gu!

12:31.870 --> 12:33.120
-Mr. Gu!
-Mr. Gu!

12:33.150 --> 12:34.080
Mr. Gu!

12:34.360 --> 12:35.670
Be careful, Mr. Gu!

12:36.600 --> 12:38.500
-Mr. Gu!
-Mr. Gu!

12:39.390 --> 12:40.690
Be careful, Mr. Gu!

12:41.550 --> 12:42.790
Heizi, quick,

12:43.030 --> 12:44.840
take our belts and tie them into a rope,
and then tie it to a stone!

12:44.840 --> 12:45.270
Got it!

12:45.320 --> 12:46.210
Hurry!

12:46.670 --> 12:47.390
Hurry!

12:47.900 --> 12:49.500
Quickly, take off your belt!

12:50.270 --> 12:51.030
Yu'er!

12:51.150 --> 12:52.870
Yu'er, don't panic!

12:52.960 --> 12:53.960
Stay calm!

13:05.790 --> 13:06.550
Give me your hand.

13:06.550 --> 13:07.260
Come a bit closer.

13:07.260 --> 13:07.860
Your hand.

13:08.840 --> 13:09.300
Come on.

13:11.850 --> 13:12.600
Stop crying.

13:12.670 --> 13:13.400
Stop crying.

13:14.410 --> 13:15.870
Don‘t exert yourself too much right now,

13:15.870 --> 13:17.400
or you'll sink even faster.

13:18.320 --> 13:18.790
Come on.

13:20.390 --> 13:21.320
Don't be afraid.

13:24.510 --> 13:25.120
Come on.

13:31.790 --> 13:33.230
It's okay. Don't be afraid.

13:33.230 --> 13:34.550
Look at me. Eyes on me.

13:36.480 --> 13:37.410
Don't be afraid.

13:39.190 --> 13:41.150
If you don't look at me a bit longer now,

13:41.150 --> 13:42.270
once I sink in,

13:42.720 --> 13:44.650
you won't be able to see me anymore.

13:45.930 --> 13:46.720
I know.

13:50.720 --> 13:52.610
Mr. Gu! Yu'er!

13:52.730 --> 13:53.840
Hold on!

13:55.320 --> 13:56.220
Mr. Gu!

13:56.880 --> 13:57.620
Hurry!

14:00.910 --> 14:02.290
I'm so useless.

14:03.030 --> 14:04.390
I've put you in danger.

14:05.120 --> 14:06.480
I've dragged all of you down.

14:06.480 --> 14:07.510
Don't say that!

14:12.270 --> 14:13.080
At worst...

14:14.640 --> 14:15.270
At worst,

14:15.270 --> 14:16.670
we'll die here together.

14:18.320 --> 14:19.650
With us dying together,

14:20.390 --> 14:21.990
what's there to be afraid of?

14:23.150 --> 14:24.810
On the road to the underworld,

14:24.910 --> 14:26.840
we'll have each other for company.

14:26.970 --> 14:28.700
We can chat and laugh together.

14:28.870 --> 14:30.130
Wouldn't that be nice?

14:35.990 --> 14:36.590
Come on.

14:37.870 --> 14:39.890
Don't move around, you two!

14:39.960 --> 14:42.360
The more you struggle,
the faster you'll sink!

14:42.360 --> 14:43.600
Yu'er, don't be afraid!

14:43.600 --> 14:44.840
I'll come save you!

14:46.030 --> 14:48.360
We need more planks.
Hurry up and get more!

14:48.960 --> 14:49.910
Quickly, go get more!

14:49.910 --> 14:50.570
Move aside.

14:51.240 --> 14:51.910
Father!

14:53.550 --> 14:54.270
Father!

14:57.150 --> 14:58.840
Mr. Gu, catch this!

15:01.270 --> 15:02.910
Hold on, Mr. Gu!

15:03.000 --> 15:03.780
Hold on!

15:05.550 --> 15:06.670
-Mr. Gu!
-Mr. Gu!

15:06.840 --> 15:07.440
Hang on!

15:07.440 --> 15:08.840
Mr. Gu, you're almost there! Come on!

15:08.840 --> 15:09.600
Grab it!

15:10.410 --> 15:12.030
Mr. Gu, Miss Chang can be saved now!

15:12.030 --> 15:14.070
Mr. Gu, pull the rope tight!

15:14.200 --> 15:15.530
Tie it around yourself!

15:21.360 --> 15:21.840
Come on.

15:24.440 --> 15:25.790
Come on, pull!

15:35.500 --> 15:37.160
I think we're going to make it.

15:37.280 --> 15:37.720
Hurry!

15:37.740 --> 15:38.510
We need more planks!

15:38.510 --> 15:39.640
Go find more! Hurry!

15:39.670 --> 15:40.210
Got it!

15:40.440 --> 15:41.560
Hurry!

15:41.670 --> 15:43.070
Let me ask you something.

15:45.530 --> 15:46.440
Earlier,

15:47.510 --> 15:48.790
did I say something that offended you

15:48.790 --> 15:49.850
and made you upset?

15:56.150 --> 15:57.350
You didn't offend me.

15:58.740 --> 15:59.790
Just now,

16:00.800 --> 16:02.630
I really thought I was going to die.

16:02.630 --> 16:03.890
When you came over,

16:04.000 --> 16:06.030
my heart was filled with joy.

16:06.560 --> 16:07.720
Even if I died,

16:08.920 --> 16:10.180
I would still be happy.

16:11.210 --> 16:12.190
Gu.

16:16.030 --> 16:16.870
I will never

16:16.890 --> 16:18.220
be angry with you again.

16:18.620 --> 16:19.600
Our lives

16:19.630 --> 16:21.000
are tied together.

16:24.120 --> 16:26.120
I've never said this to anyone else.

16:26.790 --> 16:28.860
D-Don't tell others about this, either.

16:28.860 --> 16:29.530
Come on!

16:30.030 --> 16:31.140
Hurry!

16:33.120 --> 16:34.620
I-I won't tell anyone.

16:34.820 --> 16:35.960
I won't tell anyone.

16:36.080 --> 16:36.880
Rest assured.

16:37.540 --> 16:38.550
I won't tell anyone.

16:38.550 --> 16:39.670
Pull!

16:40.300 --> 16:42.550
Come on! One, two, pull!

16:42.720 --> 16:43.550
They're up!

16:43.460 --> 16:46.790
[Military Horse Camp, Ningguta]

17:05.829 --> 17:06.440
Xu San.

17:13.960 --> 17:14.589
Why are you drinking

17:14.589 --> 17:16.319
so much alcohol in the morning?

17:17.589 --> 17:18.109
Xu San!

17:19.720 --> 17:20.310
Xu San.

17:20.680 --> 17:21.609
Wake up. Wake up.

17:21.960 --> 17:22.440
Come on.

17:23.750 --> 17:24.720
Look who's here.

17:29.480 --> 17:30.400
Look.

17:57.270 --> 17:58.160
Who...

17:59.440 --> 18:00.700
Who brought this here?

18:01.000 --> 18:02.860
It was this gentleman from Shanxi

18:02.960 --> 18:05.490
who came all the way here
after asking around.

18:10.170 --> 18:10.930
You know him?

18:11.110 --> 18:11.590
I've met him.

18:11.590 --> 18:12.370
When?

18:12.390 --> 18:13.000
On New Year's Eve.

18:13.000 --> 18:13.640
Where?

18:13.720 --> 18:14.780
In Pingyao County.

18:15.550 --> 18:16.750
If you dare lie to me,

18:17.550 --> 18:19.160
I'll chew you up alive.

18:19.180 --> 18:20.110
I wouldn't dare!

18:25.180 --> 18:25.980
That's my dog.

18:26.510 --> 18:27.510
I'll go get him.

18:28.510 --> 18:29.410
You?

18:30.440 --> 18:31.830
We've reported this to the higher-ups.

18:31.830 --> 18:33.560
They'll handle it officially.

18:34.200 --> 18:35.350
-That's my dog.
-Xu San!

18:35.350 --> 18:36.210
I'll go get him.

18:36.270 --> 18:36.760
Xu San!

18:36.790 --> 18:39.070
That's my dog. I'll go get him!

18:39.110 --> 18:40.790
That's my dog! I'll go get him!

18:40.790 --> 18:41.440
Xu San!

18:41.550 --> 18:42.160
We'll catch him

18:42.160 --> 18:44.760
and have him stay here
raising horses with you!

18:55.050 --> 18:59.620
[Horqin Grasslands]

19:10.160 --> 19:11.030
Mr. Gu!

19:11.160 --> 19:12.590
My good friend.

19:12.680 --> 19:14.010
Long time no see.

19:14.040 --> 19:15.050
You're late!

19:15.180 --> 19:17.000
We had a narrow escape from death.

19:17.000 --> 19:18.400
Just being able to meet you again

19:18.400 --> 19:19.480
is already a blessing from the heavens.

19:19.480 --> 19:20.160
Mr. Chang,

19:20.640 --> 19:21.550
we meet again.

19:22.000 --> 19:23.240
Didn't he just say?

19:23.350 --> 19:25.000
We had a narrow escape from death.

19:25.000 --> 19:26.660
Thanks to the heaven's mercy,

19:26.790 --> 19:28.000
we only lost one cart of goods.

19:28.000 --> 19:29.480
Everything else is intact.

19:29.480 --> 19:30.070
Alright.

19:30.230 --> 19:31.270
Let's head back to the camp now.

19:31.270 --> 19:33.310
Tonight, there's good wine and meat
waiting for us.

19:33.310 --> 19:34.480
Is His Highness here?

19:34.480 --> 19:35.590
I need to pay

19:35.640 --> 19:37.040
my respects to him first.

19:37.590 --> 19:38.570
That's unfortunate.

19:38.570 --> 19:40.660
His Highness has just led his troops

19:40.760 --> 19:41.880
out to fight against

19:41.880 --> 19:43.940
the Junior Khan of western Mongolia.

19:44.000 --> 19:44.640
Let's go.

19:44.930 --> 19:46.460
Let's go home first!

19:47.440 --> 19:47.970
Let's go!

20:21.880 --> 20:24.030
Come on, good friends of the horse gang!

20:24.030 --> 20:26.200
Have some food and drinks
to fill your stomachs first.

20:26.200 --> 20:27.750
We've got 10 lambs roasting.

20:27.750 --> 20:29.000
We'll continue drinking tonight.

20:29.000 --> 20:31.750
Thank you for your hospitality,
Head Butler Hanlong.

20:31.750 --> 20:32.350
Cheers!

20:32.680 --> 20:34.240
Bottoms up!

20:36.350 --> 20:37.000
Heizi.

20:38.110 --> 20:39.960
Take a few of our men

20:40.160 --> 20:41.440
and get the tents set up.

20:41.440 --> 20:43.680
Mr. Gu and I will share one.

20:44.200 --> 20:44.920
Got it.

20:45.220 --> 20:46.730
Come on, you three, follow me.

20:46.730 --> 20:47.660
-Got it.
-Got it.

20:49.030 --> 20:49.760
Head Butler.

20:50.180 --> 20:51.120
Here's to you.

20:55.490 --> 20:56.350
Maybe we should

20:56.750 --> 20:58.110
hold off on the drinking for now.

20:58.110 --> 20:58.960
I think

20:59.200 --> 21:00.400
we should distribute the medicine

21:00.400 --> 21:01.750
as soon as possible.

21:02.020 --> 21:03.490
If this disease spreads,

21:03.680 --> 21:05.010
it would be disastrous.

21:06.000 --> 21:07.400
Mr. Chang, you're right.

21:08.200 --> 21:09.440
If this disease acts up,

21:09.440 --> 21:10.920
we won't even be able to ride a horse.

21:10.920 --> 21:12.070
That's why His Highness was in a hurry

21:12.070 --> 21:13.160
for you to arrive on time.

21:13.160 --> 21:14.750
Well, we've arrived as requested.

21:14.750 --> 21:16.350
Let's first count the medicine

21:16.350 --> 21:18.310
and settle the accounts and money,

21:18.350 --> 21:20.280
then I'll drink with you
for three days and nights.

21:20.280 --> 21:20.830
How does that sound?

21:20.830 --> 21:22.490
This way, you'll feel at ease,

21:22.590 --> 21:25.300
and so will all my men.

21:25.960 --> 21:27.270
About this matter,

21:28.090 --> 21:30.090
I need to consult with His Highness.

21:34.160 --> 21:35.070
Mr. Hanlong.

21:36.110 --> 21:36.880
When His Highness left,

21:36.880 --> 21:37.920
didn't he leave any instructions?

21:37.920 --> 21:38.610
Wasn't he urgently demanding

21:38.610 --> 21:39.940
these medicinal herbs?

21:41.350 --> 21:42.880
Mr. Gu, listen to me.

21:43.170 --> 21:44.530
These worms are in our stomachs,

21:44.530 --> 21:45.620
not in yours.

21:46.350 --> 21:47.160
I just spoke with His Highness

21:47.160 --> 21:47.920
only a few days ago.

21:47.920 --> 21:49.380
Why are you in such a hurry?

21:49.880 --> 21:51.030
Is the wine on our grasslands
not good,

21:51.030 --> 21:52.360
or is the lamb not tasty?

21:53.310 --> 21:55.710
Just have a good rest
and enjoy yourselves.

22:04.030 --> 22:06.200
"Anyway, these worms are in our stomachs,

22:06.200 --> 22:07.240
not in yours."

22:07.510 --> 22:08.910
What kind of talk is that?

22:09.400 --> 22:11.180
So this Hanlong doesn't care about others

22:11.180 --> 22:13.180
just because he isn't sick himself?

22:13.680 --> 22:15.900
He was as urgent as a blazing fire
when he hurried us.

22:15.900 --> 22:17.270
We rushed here as fast as we could,

22:17.270 --> 22:19.310
and now he's saying there's no hurry.

22:19.310 --> 22:21.030
Dealing with this Hanlong

22:21.070 --> 22:22.640
really takes some effort.

22:23.200 --> 22:24.590
He's a fraud.

22:24.640 --> 22:26.080
He's not even Mongolian.

22:26.590 --> 22:27.920
If you've dealt with Mongolians before,

22:27.920 --> 22:28.640
you'd know.

22:28.960 --> 22:31.620
They don't have so many tricks
up their sleeves.

22:36.920 --> 22:37.520
Mr. Chang.

22:38.040 --> 22:39.160
Now that His Highness is away

22:39.160 --> 22:40.240
and Hanlong is in charge,

22:40.240 --> 22:41.880
with goods worth
tens of thousands of taels,

22:41.880 --> 22:43.110
he might get greedy.

23:01.310 --> 23:02.460
Nice shot!

23:02.480 --> 23:05.280
Anyone who hits the coin
gets two sheep as a reward!

23:10.640 --> 23:11.680
Mr. Gu.

23:11.750 --> 23:12.680
Let's drink.

23:14.860 --> 23:16.190
By the way, Mr. Hanlong,

23:16.960 --> 23:18.620
has His Highness replied yet?

23:18.720 --> 23:19.830
No rush.

23:19.880 --> 23:21.480
Let's drink first. Drink up.

23:21.960 --> 23:23.020
Come on, Mr. Chang.

23:25.160 --> 23:26.490
You may not be in a hurry,

23:26.510 --> 23:27.310
but what about the worms
in your people's stomachs?

23:27.310 --> 23:28.840
Are they also that patient?

23:34.520 --> 23:35.490
Mr. Gu.

23:37.730 --> 23:39.420
You're a good man.

23:40.350 --> 23:41.470
I'm a good man too.

23:43.160 --> 23:44.200
Let me make a deal with you.

23:44.200 --> 23:44.750
Would you do me

23:44.750 --> 23:45.920
a favor?

23:47.360 --> 23:47.970
Hey.

23:48.030 --> 23:49.550
What kind of talk is that?

23:49.800 --> 23:51.290
In front of you, Sir,

23:51.480 --> 23:53.080
how dare I talk about favors?

23:53.110 --> 23:54.190
Whatever you need us to do,

23:54.190 --> 23:55.390
just give the order.

23:55.590 --> 23:56.200
Cheers!

23:56.270 --> 23:57.160
Come on.

23:58.880 --> 23:59.880
Well then.

24:00.240 --> 24:01.920
His Highness has been fighting
at the front line,

24:01.920 --> 24:03.110
and things haven't been

24:03.110 --> 24:04.120
going well.

24:04.270 --> 24:06.110
He keeps pushing for the medicine.

24:06.110 --> 24:07.640
He never mentioned anything

24:07.640 --> 24:08.730
about the payment,

24:09.030 --> 24:09.960
and since he's in a bad mood,

24:09.960 --> 24:11.240
it's not the right time to ask.

24:11.240 --> 24:12.900
Since we're all friends here,

24:13.270 --> 24:15.420
just give us the medicine first.

24:16.110 --> 24:17.400
Let our soldiers take it

24:17.400 --> 24:18.550
and get their strength back.

24:18.550 --> 24:19.750
If we win this battle

24:20.310 --> 24:21.900
and His Highness is pleased, who knows,

24:21.900 --> 24:23.410
he might even reward you
with a little extra.

24:23.410 --> 24:24.100
Well,

24:24.520 --> 24:25.760
that does sound good.

24:26.810 --> 24:27.660
It's just I...

24:27.960 --> 24:29.270
It's just the members of our horse gang

24:29.270 --> 24:30.400
all come from poor backgrounds.

24:30.400 --> 24:31.960
They all have families to feed.

24:31.960 --> 24:32.960
If we stay too long

24:32.960 --> 24:33.790
on the grasslands,

24:33.790 --> 24:34.590
waiting for His Highness

24:34.590 --> 24:35.650
to win the battle before we could go back,

24:35.650 --> 24:37.160
their families will have starved to death.

24:37.160 --> 24:38.290
How about this?

24:38.790 --> 24:40.160
Pay our men's travel fees

24:40.160 --> 24:41.030
and the cost of the medicine

24:41.030 --> 24:41.850
in full,

24:42.030 --> 24:43.680
and let Mr. Chang return to Pingyao.

24:43.680 --> 24:45.340
When the weather gets warmer,

24:45.350 --> 24:46.370
we'll come back to Horqin

24:46.370 --> 24:47.920
to thank His Highness properly.

24:47.920 --> 24:48.720
I'll stay here

24:49.030 --> 24:49.920
and drink with you.

24:49.920 --> 24:51.190
Mr. Gu.

24:53.030 --> 24:54.760
For this small amount of money,

24:55.400 --> 24:56.440
you don't even care about

24:56.440 --> 24:57.750
the lives of our Mongolians

24:57.750 --> 24:58.510
at all.

24:58.550 --> 24:59.440
No, that's not true.

24:59.440 --> 25:00.270
Then I can't

25:00.290 --> 25:01.310
consider you my friend anymore.

25:01.310 --> 25:03.290
I'll immediately send someone

25:03.350 --> 25:04.480
to inquire about it.

25:04.550 --> 25:05.750
Even if we have to take a beating,

25:05.750 --> 25:07.610
I'll settle the payment with you.

25:09.640 --> 25:11.770
Thank you very much then, Mr. Hanlong.

25:22.480 --> 25:23.880
At the end of the day,

25:24.270 --> 25:26.350
Hanlong just doesn't want to pay.

25:26.920 --> 25:28.610
So the noble prince's people
are actually trying to rob us?

25:28.610 --> 25:29.410
Keep it down.

25:30.920 --> 25:32.000
We're on their territory.

25:32.000 --> 25:33.070
They have strong forces.

25:33.070 --> 25:34.640
Even if they really want to take it
by force, what can you do?

25:34.640 --> 25:35.480
We can't fight them,

25:35.480 --> 25:36.610
and we can't escape.

25:37.960 --> 25:39.220
Over the past few days,

25:39.240 --> 25:40.870
Hanlong has been gradually

25:41.310 --> 25:43.040
bringing in about 100 cavalry.

25:43.200 --> 25:44.110
At first I thought

25:44.110 --> 25:46.170
he was sending them to the front line.

25:46.240 --> 25:46.940
But it turns out

25:46.940 --> 25:48.540
they're here to surround us.

25:50.680 --> 25:52.010
Are we going to die here?

25:54.920 --> 25:55.880
If we really go back

25:55.880 --> 25:57.280
empty-handed like this,

25:58.440 --> 26:00.200
not to mention our men's travel fees,

26:00.200 --> 26:01.590
how are we going to pay

26:01.610 --> 26:03.000
for all those carts of medicine?

26:03.000 --> 26:05.130
They're really pushing us to the edge.

26:07.830 --> 26:09.300
If there's no other way,

26:09.920 --> 26:11.980
we'll have to give them the medicine.

26:12.030 --> 26:12.830
These men

26:12.880 --> 26:14.400
all came with me from home.

26:15.270 --> 26:16.480
I must bring every single one of them back

26:16.480 --> 26:17.560
safe and sound.

26:18.000 --> 26:19.590
They absolutely cannot die here.

26:19.590 --> 26:20.190
Mr. Chang.

26:20.880 --> 26:21.550
If you leave the medicine

26:21.550 --> 26:22.480
here for them,

26:22.590 --> 26:23.910
we'll only die faster.

26:24.440 --> 26:25.270
Hanlong will definitely

26:25.270 --> 26:26.530
send a cavalry unit to chase us,

26:26.530 --> 26:27.790
intercept us on the way,

26:27.790 --> 26:29.090
and slaughter us all.

26:29.350 --> 26:30.850
We can't back down on this.

26:31.240 --> 26:32.900
We need to fight them head-on.

26:34.510 --> 26:36.110
I've come up with an idea,

26:36.160 --> 26:37.160
but we need to act immediately.

26:37.160 --> 26:38.560
It has to be done tonight.

27:08.200 --> 27:09.000
We Mongolians

27:09.000 --> 27:10.270
are all sick like this,

27:10.750 --> 27:12.510
yet they refuse to give us the medicine

27:12.510 --> 27:14.240
and even want to charge us more.

27:15.750 --> 27:16.550
Today,

27:17.680 --> 27:18.640
we're going to

27:18.640 --> 27:20.300
teach them a lesson properly.

27:22.680 --> 27:23.880
-Let's go!
-Let's go!

27:35.540 --> 27:36.240
Mr. Hanlong.

27:36.240 --> 27:37.300
What's this about?

27:43.180 --> 27:43.790
You...

27:51.090 --> 27:51.780
Mr. Gu.

27:52.830 --> 27:53.440
Ms. Chang.

27:53.790 --> 27:54.590
Why are you here?

27:54.590 --> 27:55.550
I found two horses.

27:55.550 --> 27:56.130
They're right outside.

27:56.130 --> 27:56.850
Let's go now.

27:56.850 --> 27:57.840
You're being ridiculous.

27:57.840 --> 27:58.840
Go back right now!

27:58.960 --> 28:00.000
Where to?

28:00.030 --> 28:01.360
Back to let him tie me up?

28:06.720 --> 28:07.260
Let's go.

28:31.350 --> 28:32.610
Where's the medicine?

28:32.820 --> 28:33.960
Go find it!

28:34.000 --> 28:34.930
Yes!

28:35.000 --> 28:37.070
Let's go find the medicine!

29:00.920 --> 29:02.260
My father told me

29:02.400 --> 29:04.590
that in recent years,
outsiders have been raiding this area,

29:04.590 --> 29:06.310
and the Mongol tribes
have been in constant turmoil.

29:06.310 --> 29:08.550
They fight over rivers, over pasturelands,

29:08.550 --> 29:10.310
and they even seize each other's children.

29:10.310 --> 29:12.040
Such beautiful grasslands...

29:12.360 --> 29:14.890
Yet now they're
consumed by war and conflict.

29:35.070 --> 29:35.720
Shoot!

29:50.830 --> 29:51.790
Chang Si!

29:52.550 --> 29:53.200
My medicine!

29:53.200 --> 29:54.270
-Don't touch him!
-Don't move!

29:54.270 --> 29:55.140
Go away!

29:55.550 --> 29:56.750
Where's my medicine?

30:00.270 --> 30:02.160
See that pit over there?

30:05.550 --> 30:06.030
I do.

30:06.160 --> 30:08.120
That's where you'll all be buried.

30:09.930 --> 30:11.440
There are only a few of us.

30:11.480 --> 30:13.080
Why did you dig such a big pit?

30:16.230 --> 30:17.310
Laughing, huh?

30:18.830 --> 30:19.830
Laughing, huh?

30:20.240 --> 30:21.000
Laughing, huh?

30:21.000 --> 30:22.060
Clueless fools!

30:22.270 --> 30:23.310
Keep laughing, huh?

30:23.310 --> 30:23.850
Where did you hide the medicine?

30:23.850 --> 30:24.380
Hanlong!

30:27.440 --> 30:28.950
Do you really think

30:29.030 --> 30:30.110
there's no one in this world

30:30.110 --> 30:31.200
who can control you anymore?

30:31.200 --> 30:31.720
Do you?

30:32.550 --> 30:33.670
In broad daylight,

30:33.700 --> 30:35.100
with everyone watching,

30:35.240 --> 30:37.070
you plan to rob us outright?

30:38.000 --> 30:40.360
You're even worse than bandits!

30:40.480 --> 30:43.010
His Highness won't spare you
when he returns!

30:43.110 --> 30:44.640
When His Highness returns?

30:46.160 --> 30:48.710
When His Highness returns, I'll tell him

30:49.070 --> 30:51.910
that your goods were never delivered.

30:52.350 --> 30:55.210
Delaying military affairs is punishable
by death.

30:56.350 --> 30:57.070
Fine.

30:58.110 --> 30:58.680
Come on.

30:59.510 --> 31:00.920
A real man keeps

31:01.030 --> 31:02.310
his word.

31:02.480 --> 31:04.030
If you don't bury us alive today,

31:04.030 --> 31:05.270
right here,

31:05.590 --> 31:08.150
then you're nothing but a darn coward!

31:08.170 --> 31:08.960
That's right!

31:08.960 --> 31:10.350
A darn coward!

31:10.400 --> 31:11.400
Lead the way!

31:28.390 --> 31:29.160
Do you see that

31:29.160 --> 31:30.310
purple-red battle flag?

31:30.200 --> 31:31.430
[Jasagh]

31:33.960 --> 31:34.510
That should be

31:34.510 --> 31:36.110
Prince Horqin's territory.

31:36.160 --> 31:37.960
That bluish-green one over there

31:37.960 --> 31:40.620
should be the western Mongolian
Senior Khan's.

31:49.870 --> 31:51.200
Look at that one behind,

31:51.310 --> 31:52.640
that tent without a top.

31:53.110 --> 31:54.110
That should be

31:54.110 --> 31:55.440
where Prince Horqin is.

31:57.440 --> 31:58.530
It's so far away.

32:00.750 --> 32:02.280
There might be another way.

32:03.650 --> 32:06.050
I can cut straight across the battlefield.

32:16.510 --> 32:17.070
Shoot!

32:23.480 --> 32:24.210
You can't go.

32:25.440 --> 32:26.240
Be good and listen to me.

32:26.240 --> 32:27.400
Why should I listen to you?

32:27.400 --> 32:29.110
You should be the one listening to me.

32:29.110 --> 32:30.720
There are tens of thousands of people
on that battlefield,

32:30.720 --> 32:31.880
firing cannons nonstop.

32:31.880 --> 32:33.160
How many heads do you have
to make it through alive?

32:33.160 --> 32:34.090
So what are you suggesting?

32:34.090 --> 32:35.240
Take time to go around it?

32:35.240 --> 32:36.400
We already spent so much time

32:36.400 --> 32:36.960
coming around this way.

32:36.960 --> 32:38.070
If you die on the battlefield,

32:38.070 --> 32:39.480
you'll be no better than a worm.

32:39.480 --> 32:40.640
This camp isn't that big.

32:40.640 --> 32:41.640
If they search thoroughly,

32:41.640 --> 32:42.310
they'll quickly find out

32:42.310 --> 32:43.570
where the medicine is.

32:43.590 --> 32:44.200
Since we got out of there

32:44.200 --> 32:45.000
together,

32:45.310 --> 32:46.750
we absolutely can't die together.

32:46.750 --> 32:48.210
I have to take this gamble.

32:48.770 --> 32:49.570
Get in!

32:50.850 --> 32:51.480
Get in!

32:55.680 --> 32:56.160
Are you okay?

32:56.160 --> 32:56.690
I'm okay.

33:04.590 --> 33:05.680
Chang Si.

33:06.270 --> 33:08.380
Who's the darn coward now, huh?

33:10.070 --> 33:11.330
Where's the medicine?

33:17.350 --> 33:18.370
That Mr. Gu

33:18.400 --> 33:19.790
and your daughter

33:19.870 --> 33:21.490
also stole two of my horses.

33:23.070 --> 33:24.030
That I didn't know.

33:24.030 --> 33:25.920
You think I'm a three-year-old
or something?

33:25.920 --> 33:27.260
There are hundreds of cannons over there

33:27.260 --> 33:28.920
and 40,000 to 50,000 cavalry.

33:29.000 --> 33:31.110
If those two try to petition His Majesty,

33:31.110 --> 33:32.070
I'm afraid there won't even be

33:32.070 --> 33:33.670
bone fragments left of them.

33:33.920 --> 33:35.920
I'm actually giving you a chance now

33:35.920 --> 33:37.320
by asking you questions.

33:38.590 --> 33:40.110
You're giving me a chance?

33:41.110 --> 33:42.960
Since I, Chang Si,
dared to take my daughter

33:42.960 --> 33:45.020
and my men through Black Water Marsh,

33:45.200 --> 33:47.800
I've already placed my life
in heaven's hands.

33:48.270 --> 33:49.350
Now that the medicine's gone,

33:49.350 --> 33:51.880
I'd like to see how you'll explain this
to His Highness.

33:51.880 --> 33:52.590
Bury us!

33:52.750 --> 33:54.010
You think I don't dare?

33:54.590 --> 33:56.180
Just wait and see whether His Highness
will believe me

33:56.180 --> 33:57.510
or them when he comes back!

33:57.510 --> 33:58.270
Found it!

35:56.400 --> 35:57.630
Old Chang.

35:58.440 --> 36:00.070
Quite cunning, aren't you?

36:01.150 --> 36:02.920
Hiding the goods under the stable,

36:02.920 --> 36:04.650
thinking I wouldn't find them.

36:06.110 --> 36:07.400
In your next life,

36:08.280 --> 36:10.340
you'd better pray to the Bodhisattva

36:11.090 --> 36:12.150
for a better fate.

36:13.280 --> 36:14.110
Bury them!

37:50.790 --> 37:51.720
Why are you here?

37:52.080 --> 37:53.880
I'm here to collect your corpse!

39:05.710 --> 39:06.400
Let's go!

39:07.190 --> 39:08.010
Attack!

39:12.190 --> 39:13.060
Nobody move!

39:13.150 --> 39:14.210
Put your guns down!

39:14.230 --> 39:16.640
-Put your guns down!
-Or I'll kill him!

39:17.190 --> 39:17.840
Chang Si,

39:17.880 --> 39:18.940
you wouldn't dare!

39:19.150 --> 39:19.960
Hanlong.

39:20.400 --> 39:21.830
Do you think I, Chang Si,

39:22.310 --> 39:23.540
am just a lump of dough

39:23.590 --> 39:24.820
for you to knead however you want?

39:24.820 --> 39:25.700
Chang Si,

39:26.510 --> 39:26.920
you wouldn't dare!

39:26.920 --> 39:27.550
Heizi,

39:27.960 --> 39:28.620
tie them up!

39:28.790 --> 39:31.200
[Prince Horqin's Military Camp]

39:32.840 --> 39:33.400
Move it!

39:34.150 --> 39:34.900
Get in!

39:35.280 --> 39:35.920
Hurry up!

39:35.960 --> 39:36.480
Move it!

39:38.150 --> 39:38.590
Hurry!

39:39.510 --> 39:40.190
The newly caught—

39:40.190 --> 39:41.150
send the man to the army,

39:41.150 --> 39:42.410
make the woman a slave,

39:42.510 --> 39:43.760
and have her serve Her Ladyship.

39:43.760 --> 39:44.360
Come here!

39:45.030 --> 39:45.710
Ms. Chang!

39:46.190 --> 39:46.920
Get in there!

39:47.960 --> 39:48.560
Come here!

39:50.360 --> 39:50.840
Get in!

40:11.230 --> 40:12.090
Work properly.

40:12.440 --> 40:13.100
Otherwise,

40:14.210 --> 40:15.590
I'll strangle you to death!

40:15.590 --> 40:17.520
Serve Her Ladyship properly here!

40:28.780 --> 40:30.000
What are you looking at?

40:30.000 --> 40:31.000
Behave yourself!

40:38.460 --> 40:39.590
If you try to escape,

40:40.230 --> 40:41.280
you'll die.

40:42.380 --> 40:44.310
Your horse isn't as fast as theirs,

40:44.510 --> 40:45.840
and you don't have a bow.

40:47.280 --> 40:48.740
Don't do anything stupid.

40:50.150 --> 40:51.610
I still have a friend here.

40:52.550 --> 40:53.680
I need to go find her.

40:57.440 --> 40:58.160
Friend?

41:02.000 --> 41:03.150
In this place,

41:03.510 --> 41:05.190
I haven't heard

41:05.190 --> 41:06.250
that word in years.

41:15.320 --> 41:16.120
What's wrong?

41:17.020 --> 41:18.040
What's going on?

41:19.440 --> 41:20.350
It's a plague!

41:20.630 --> 41:21.760
It's the Black Plague!

41:21.760 --> 41:22.710
Everyone stay away from him!

41:22.710 --> 41:23.480
It's the Black Plague!

41:23.480 --> 41:24.000
Quick! Quick!

41:24.000 --> 41:26.260
-Stay away from him!
-Stay away from him!

41:26.360 --> 41:27.380
Black Plague!

41:27.480 --> 41:28.540
Stay away from him!

41:34.670 --> 41:35.360
Stop!

41:35.630 --> 41:36.630
Stop right there!

41:39.590 --> 41:40.440
Stop!

41:40.800 --> 41:41.550
Shoot!

41:41.880 --> 41:42.550
Shoot!

41:46.760 --> 41:47.220
My Lady.

41:49.920 --> 41:50.780
Please come in.

41:52.710 --> 41:54.070
Go ask His Highness to come here.

41:54.070 --> 41:54.590
Yes.

42:02.780 --> 42:03.640
Your Highness.

42:11.910 --> 42:13.720
[Prince Horqin]

42:12.440 --> 42:14.770
How could they fight the battle like this?

42:16.590 --> 42:17.450
Your Highness.

42:17.800 --> 42:19.830
[Prince Horqin's Wife]

42:18.400 --> 42:20.230
We can't afford to lose any more soldiers.

42:20.230 --> 42:22.360
You must stop scolding them like this.

42:22.670 --> 42:24.870
No matter how accurate our archers are,

42:25.360 --> 42:27.280
their arrows are no match for
the enemy's firearms.

42:27.280 --> 42:29.010
How did things end up like this?

42:29.180 --> 42:30.400
Colluding with outsiders

42:30.400 --> 42:31.930
and killing our own people—

42:32.030 --> 42:33.550
how can that be called being a hero?

42:33.550 --> 42:35.550
They don't care about being heroes.

42:37.000 --> 42:37.860
Your Highness.

42:38.560 --> 42:40.820
What they want is the Horqin Grasslands.

42:41.550 --> 42:43.070
If I were defeated,

42:43.590 --> 42:45.550
I could give him the grassland,

42:46.030 --> 42:48.490
but that would be giving it to
our own people.

42:49.400 --> 42:51.330
But now that he's become a traitor,

42:51.550 --> 42:54.000
I won't give him a single inch of land!

42:55.060 --> 42:55.740
Unless

42:56.320 --> 42:57.800
the blood here runs dry!

42:58.400 --> 42:59.260
Your Highness.

42:59.320 --> 43:00.430
The Junior Khan of western Mongolia
is here.
